{"id":"sicherlich","lemma":"sicherlich","pos":"adv","rank":1890,"glosses":["certainly"],"ipa":"/ˈzɪçɐˌlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9f/De-sicherlich.ogg/De-sicherlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie wurden sicherlich bemerkt.","en":"They certainly got noticed.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"to notice, to perceive","l":"bemerken"}]},{"text":"Das ist sicherlich nicht nötig.","en":"I'm sure that's not necessary.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"urgently"}]},{"text":"Sie ist sicherlich über vierzig.","en":"She is certainly above forty.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"forty"}]},{"text":"Es ist sicherlich eine Zeitverschwendung.","en":"It's certainly a waste of time.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"waste of time"}]},{"text":"Tom ist sicherlich ein guter Vater.","en":"Tom certainly is a good father.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"father"}]}]}